<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">管理端 / REVIEW DESK</text><text class="title">审核工作台</text><text class="muted">评论与人物事实分开处理；未审核内容不会对普通用户公开。</text></view><view wx:if="{{!admin}}" class="card"><view class="notice error">当前账户没有管理员权限，或登录已过期。管理员由服务端授权，普通注册不能获得该角色。</view><button class="primary full" bindtap="login">返回登录</button></view><view wx:else><view class="metrics"><view class="metric"><text>{{pendingComments}}</text><text>待审核评论</text></view><view class="metric"><text>{{pendingFacts}}</text><text>待核人物事实</text></view></view><view class="tabs"><button class="tab {{tab==='comments'?'active':''}}" data-tab="comments" bindtap="switchTab">评论审核</button><button class="tab {{tab==='facts'?'active':''}}" data-tab="facts" bindtap="switchTab">人物事实</button></view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">加载中…</view><view wx:elif="{{!items.length}}" class="empty"><text class="section-title">暂无待办</text><text>没有待处理内容时，不用样例数据充数。</text></view><view wx:else wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="item"><view class="item-head"><view><text>{{tab==='comments'?item.author.nickname:(item.person+' · '+item.field)}}</text><text class="topic">{{tab==='comments'?item.topicTitle:item.value}}</text></view><text class="status {{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{tab==='comments'}}" class="comment">{{item.content}}</text><text wx:else class="small">来源线索：{{item.evidence}}</text><text class="small">当前版本 {{item.version}}</text><label wx:if="{{rejectingId===item.id}}" class="field">退回原因<textarea value="{{reason}}" bindinput="reasonInput" maxlength="300" placeholder="说明需补充的来源或修改内容。" /></label><view wx:if="{{rejectingId===item.id}}" class="row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="cancelReject">取消</button><button class="danger" bindtap="confirmReject">确认退回</button></view><view wx:elif="{{item.status==='pending'}}" class="row"><button class="primary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-version="{{item.version}}" data-decision="{{tab==='comments'?'approved':'published'}}" bindtap="review">{{tab==='comments'?'通过并公开':'核验后发布'}}</button><button class="danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-version="{{item.version}}" data-decision="rejected" bindtap="review">退回补充</button></view><view wx:if="{{item.reviewReason}}" class="notice error">处理说明：{{item.reviewReason}}</view></view></view></view></view>
